+/**
+ * Retailer pages change often. Keep every retailer isolated here so a single
+ * broken search page never blocks the other three providers.
+ *
+ * For Hmall/HiMart we deliberately start from their current shopping front
+ * page and let the injected script use the site's own search input. Their old
+ * public search URLs now return 404/empty shells, so hard-coding those URLs is
+ * less reliable than driving the site's own search UI.
+ */
